---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 276;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Earnings yield of a stock at P/E 15 is 6.67 percent. Against a 4 percent deposit the spare yield is 2.67 points; against a 6 percent deposit it is 0.67 points.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Why a rate hike pulls on every stock: the deposit is the alternative</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao tăng lãi suất kéo mọi cổ phiếu: tiền gửi là lựa chọn thay thế</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="79" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Stock at P/E 15: earnings yield</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ phiếu P/E 15: tỷ suất lợi nhuận</tspan></text>
      <rect x="230" y="60" width="466.7" height="28" class="barm" rx="4" />
      <text x="706.6666666666667" y="79" class="h">6.67%</text>
      <text x="20" y="131" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Deposit at 4%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gửi tiết kiệm 4%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="230" y="112" width="280.0" height="28" class="barg" rx="4" />
      <text x="520.0" y="131" class="h">4.00%</text>
      <text x="20" y="183" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Deposit at 6%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gửi tiết kiệm 6%</tspan></text>
      <rect x="230" y="164" width="420.0" height="28" class="barr" rx="4" />
      <text x="660.0" y="183" class="h">6.00%</text>
      <text x="20" y="236" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Spare yield over a deposit: 2.67 points at 4%, 0.67 points at 6%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phần lợi nhuận hơn gửi tiết kiệm: 2,67 điểm khi lãi gửi 4%, 0,67 điểm khi 6%</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="258" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Same stock, same price: only the deposit rate moved.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng cổ phiếu, cùng giá: chỉ có lãi gửi thay đổi.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Assumed stock: P/E 15 (earnings yield 1 ÷ 15 = 6.67%, the E/P idea from Post 7). Deposit rates of 4% and 6% are assumptions chosen to match the policy-rate range of 2022. For the same risk, the stock has to show a wider spare yield, or its price gives way.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử cổ phiếu P/E 15 (tỷ suất 1 ÷ 15 = 6,67%, ý E/P của Bài 7). Lãi gửi 4% và 6% là giả định, lấy theo biên độ lãi suất điều hành năm 2022. Với cùng rủi ro, cổ phiếu phải hơn tiền gửi một khoảng đủ rộng, nếu không giá phải nhường.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08earningsyieldgap figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
